# SymbolicShapeMeta (符号形状元数据管理)

来源: c10/core/SymbolicShapeMeta.cpp, c10/core/SymbolicShapeMeta.h

---

## 【状态】

```
sizes_: SymDimVector = [0]                              # 张量各维度大小
strides_: SymDimVector = [1]                            # 张量各维度步长
storage_offset_: SymInt = 0                             # 存储偏移量
strides_valid_: bool = true                             # 步长是否有效（稀疏张量无步长）

# 懒初始化的缓存字段（mutable，通过 mutables_ 互斥锁保护）
numel_: SymInt = 1                                      # 元素总数
is_contiguous_: SymBool = true                          # 是否连续
is_channels_last_contiguous_: SymBool = false           # 是否 channels_last 连续
is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_: SymBool = false        # 是否 channels_last_3d 连续
is_channels_last_: SymBool = false                      # 是否 channels_last 布局
is_channels_last_3d_: SymBool = false                   # 是否 channels_last_3d 布局
is_non_overlapping_and_dense_: SymBool = true           # 是否非重叠且稠密

# 可用性标记（原子变量，位掩码）
available_: atomic<int> = 0
    # 位定义:
    # bit 0: numel_avail
    # bit 1: is_contiguous_avail
    # bit 2: is_channels_last_contiguous_avail
    # bit 3: is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_avail
    # bit 4: is_channels_last_avail
    # bit 5: is_channels_last_3d_avail
    # bit 6: is_non_overlapping_and_dense_avail

mutables_: mutex                                        # 保护可变字段的互斥锁
```

---

## 【接口】

### 构造与状态管理

```
SymbolicShapeMeta(other: SymbolicShapeMeta)
    用途: 拷贝构造，非可变字段直接拷贝，可变字段加锁拷贝
    算法:
        sizes_ = other.sizes_
        strides_ = other.strides_
        storage_offset_ = other.storage_offset_
        strides_valid_ = other.strides_valid_
        
        lock(other.mutables_):
            numel_ = other.numel_
            is_contiguous_ = other.is_contiguous_
            is_channels_last_contiguous_ = other.is_channels_last_contiguous_
            is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_ = other.is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_
            is_channels_last_ = other.is_channels_last_
            is_channels_last_3d_ = other.is_channels_last_3d_
            is_non_overlapping_and_dense_ = other.is_non_overlapping_and_dense_
            available_.store(other.available_.load())

refresh_numel()
    用途: 清除 numel 缓存，重置为 1
    算法:
        available_.fetch_and(~numel_avail)
        numel_ = 1

refresh_contiguous()
    用途: 清除所有连续性缓存，重置为默认值
    算法:
        available_.fetch_and(numel_avail)  # 只保留 numel_avail
        is_contiguous_ = false
        is_channels_last_contiguous_ = false
        is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_ = false
        is_channels_last_ = false
        is_channels_last_3d_ = false
        is_non_overlapping_and_dense_ = false

dim() -> int64
    用途: 返回张量维度数
    算法: return sizes_.size()
```

### 懒初始化访问器

```
numel() -> SymInt
    用途: 获取元素总数，首次访问时计算
    算法:
        if not has_numel():
            init_numel()
        return numel_

is_contiguous() -> SymBool
    用途: 获取连续性，首次访问时计算
    算法:
        if not has_is_contiguous():
            init_is_contiguous()
        return is_contiguous_

is_channels_last_contiguous() -> SymBool
    用途: 获取 channels_last 连续性，首次访问时计算
    算法:
        if not has_is_channels_last_contiguous():
            init_is_channels_last_contiguous()
        return is_channels_last_contiguous_

is_channels_last_3d_contiguous() -> SymBool
    用途: 获取 channels_last_3d 连续性，首次访问时计算
    算法:
        if not has_is_channels_last_3d_contiguous():
            init_is_channels_last_3d_contiguous()
        return is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_

is_channels_last() -> SymBool
    用途: 获取 channels_last 布局，首次访问时计算
    算法:
        if not has_is_channels_last():
            init_is_channels_last()
        return is_channels_last_

is_channels_last_3d() -> SymBool
    用途: 获取 channels_last_3d 布局，首次访问时计算
    算法:
        if not has_is_channels_last_3d():
            init_is_channels_last_3d()
        return is_channels_last_3d_

is_non_overlapping_and_dense() -> SymBool
    用途: 获取非重叠且稠密属性，首次访问时计算
    算法:
        if not has_is_non_overlapping_and_dense():
            init_is_non_overlapping_and_dense()
        return is_non_overlapping_and_dense_
```

### 假设接口（非 const，无需加锁）

```
assume_contiguous(val: SymBool = true)
    用途: 直接设置连续性假设，跳过计算
    算法:
        is_contiguous_ = val
        available_.fetch_or(is_contiguous_avail)

assume_channels_last_contiguous(val: SymBool = true)
    用途: 直接设置 channels_last 连续性假设
    算法:
        is_contiguous_ = val  # 注意：原代码有 bug，应该是 is_channels_last_contiguous_
        available_.fetch_or(is_channels_last_contiguous_avail)

assume_channels_last_3d_contiguous(val: SymBool = true)
    用途: 直接设置 channels_last_3d 连续性假设
    算法:
        is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_ = val
        available_.fetch_or(is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_avail)

assume_channels_last(val: SymBool = true)
    用途: 直接设置 channels_last 布局假设
    算法:
        is_channels_last_ = val
        available_.fetch_or(is_channels_last_avail)

assume_channels_last_3d(val: SymBool = true)
    用途: 直接设置 channels_last_3d 布局假设
    算法:
        is_channels_last_3d_ = val
        available_.fetch_or(is_channels_last_3d_avail)

assume_non_overlapping_and_dense(val: SymBool = true)
    用途: 直接设置非重叠且稠密假设
    算法:
        is_non_overlapping_and_dense_ = val
        available_.fetch_or(is_non_overlapping_and_dense_avail)
```

---

## 【私有计算函数】

### 基础计算

```
compute_contiguous() -> SymBool
    用途: 计算是否连续
    算法:
        if not strides_valid_:
            return false
        return _compute_contiguous(sizes_, strides_, numel())

compute_channels_last_contiguous_2d() -> SymBool
    用途: 计算是否 2D channels_last 连续
    算法:
        if not strides_valid_:
            return false
        return _compute_channels_last_contiguous_2d(sizes_, strides_)

compute_channels_last_contiguous_3d() -> SymBool
    用途: 计算是否 3D channels_last 连续
    算法:
        if not strides_valid_:
            return false
        return _compute_channels_last_contiguous_3d(sizes_, strides_)

compute_strides_like_channels_last_2d() -> SymBool
    用途: 计算步长是否类似 2D channels_last
    算法:
        if not strides_valid_:
            return false
        return is_channels_last_strides_2d(sizes_, strides_)

compute_strides_like_channels_last_3d() -> SymBool
    用途: 计算步长是否类似 3D channels_last
    算法:
        if not strides_valid_:
            return false
        return is_channels_last_strides_3d(sizes_, strides_)

compute_non_overlapping_and_dense() -> SymBool
    用途: 计算是否非重叠且稠密（带符号节点优化）
    算法:
        if not strides_valid_:
            return false
        
        n = normalize_sym_sizes_strides(sizes_, strides_)
        if n.has_value():
            [base, size_nodes, stride_nodes] = n
            return SymBool(base->is_non_overlapping_and_dense(size_nodes, stride_nodes))
        else:
            return _compute_non_overlapping_and_dense(sizes_, strides_)
```

### 维度特定的组合计算（带短路优化）

```
compute_is_non_overlapping_and_dense_dim4() -> SymBool
    用途: 4D 张量的非重叠且稠密计算
    算法:
        init_is_contiguous()
        if definitely_true(is_contiguous()):
            return true
        
        init_is_channels_last_contiguous()
        if definitely_true(is_channels_last_contiguous()):
            return true
        
        return is_contiguous() | is_channels_last_contiguous() | compute_non_overlapping_and_dense()

compute_channels_last_contiguous_3d_dim5() -> SymBool
    用途: 5D 张量的 3D channels_last 连续性计算
    算法:
        init_is_channels_last_contiguous()
        if definitely_true(is_channels_last_contiguous()):
            return false
        
        return ~is_channels_last_contiguous() & compute_channels_last_contiguous_3d()

compute_channels_last_2d_dim5() -> SymBool
    用途: 5D 张量的 2D channels_last 布局计算
    算法:
        init_is_channels_last_3d_contiguous()
        if definitely_true(is_channels_last_3d_contiguous()):
            return false
        
        return ~is_channels_last_3d_contiguous() & compute_strides_like_channels_last_2d()

compute_channels_last_3d_dim5() -> SymBool
    用途: 5D 张量的 3D channels_last 布局计算
    算法:
        if definitely_true(is_channels_last()):
            return false
        
        return ~is_channels_last() & compute_strides_like_channels_last_3d()

compute_is_non_overlapping_and_dense_dim5() -> SymBool
    用途: 5D 张量的非重叠且稠密计算
    算法:
        if definitely_true(is_contiguous()):
            return true
        if definitely_true(is_channels_last_contiguous()):
            return true
        if definitely_true(is_channels_last_3d_contiguous()):
            return true
        
        return is_contiguous() | is_channels_last_contiguous() | 
               is_channels_last_3d_contiguous() | compute_non_overlapping_and_dense()

compute_is_non_overlapping_and_dense_anydim() -> SymBool
    用途: 任意维度的非重叠且稠密计算
    算法:
        if definitely_true(is_contiguous()):
            return true
        
        return is_contiguous() | compute_non_overlapping_and_dense()
```

### 初始化函数（加锁设置）

```
init_numel()
    用途: 初始化元素总数
    算法: set_numel(multiply_integers(sizes_))

init_is_contiguous()
    用途: 初始化连续性
    算法: set_is_contiguous(compute_contiguous())

init_is_channels_last_contiguous()
    用途: 初始化 channels_last 连续性
    算法:
        match dim():
            4 | 5:
                set_is_channels_last_contiguous(compute_channels_last_contiguous_2d())
            _:
                set_is_channels_last_contiguous(false)

init_is_channels_last_3d_contiguous()
    用途: 初始化 channels_last_3d 连续性
    算法:
        match dim():
            5:
                set_is_channels_last_3d_contiguous(compute_channels_last_contiguous_3d_dim5())
            _:
                set_is_channels_last_3d_contiguous(false)

init_is_channels_last()
    用途: 初始化 channels_last 布局
    算法:
        match dim():
            5:
                set_is_channels_last(compute_channels_last_2d_dim5())
            4:
                set_is_channels_last(compute_strides_like_channels_last_2d())
            _:
                set_is_channels_last(false)

init_is_channels_last_3d()
    用途: 初始化 channels_last_3d 布局
    算法:
        match dim():
            5:
                set_is_channels_last_3d(compute_channels_last_3d_dim5())
            _:
                set_is_channels_last_3d(false)

init_is_non_overlapping_and_dense()
    用途: 初始化非重叠且稠密属性
    算法:
        match dim():
            5:
                set_is_non_overlapping_and_dense(compute_is_non_overlapping_and_dense_dim5())
            4:
                set_is_non_overlapping_and_dense(compute_is_non_overlapping_and_dense_dim4())
            _:
                set_is_non_overlapping_and_dense(compute_is_non_overlapping_and_dense_anydim())
```

### Setter 函数（加锁，仅在未设置时生效）

```
set_numel(val: SymInt)
    用途: 设置 numel 缓存
    算法:
        lock(mutables_):
            if has_numel():
                return
            numel_ = val
            available_.fetch_or(numel_avail)

set_is_contiguous(val: SymBool)
    用途: 设置连续性缓存
    算法:
        lock(mutables_):
            if has_is_contiguous():
                return
            is_contiguous_ = val
            available_.fetch_or(is_contiguous_avail)

set_is_channels_last_contiguous(val: SymBool)
    用途: 设置 channels_last 连续性缓存
    算法:
        lock(mutables_):
            if has_is_channels_last_contiguous():
                return
            is_channels_last_contiguous_ = val
            available_.fetch_or(is_channels_last_contiguous_avail)

set_is_channels_last_3d_contiguous(val: SymBool)
    用途: 设置 channels_last_3d 连续性缓存
    算法:
        lock(mutables_):
            if has_is_channels_last_3d_contiguous():
                return
            is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_ = val
            available_.fetch_or(is_channels_last_3d_contiguous_avail)

set_is_channels_last(val: SymBool)
    用途: 设置 channels_last 布局缓存
    算法:
        lock(mutables_):
            if has_is_channels_last():
                return
            is_channels_last_ = val
            available_.fetch_or(is_channels_last_avail)

set_is_channels_last_3d(val: SymBool)
    用途: 设置 channels_last_3d 布局缓存
    算法:
        lock(mutables_):
            if has_is_channels_last_3d():
                return
            is_channels_last_3d_ = val
            available_.fetch_or(is_channels_last_3d_avail)

set_is_non_overlapping_and_dense(val: SymBool)
    用途: 设置非重叠且稠密缓存
    算法:
        lock(mutables_):
            if has_is_non_overlapping_and_dense():
                return
            is_non_overlapping_and_dense_ = val
            available_.fetch_or(is_non_overlapping_and_dense_avail)
```

